{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46の井上梨名です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9枚目シングル「自業自得」皆さんのもとにお届けすることができて嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲たくさん聴いてくれているかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJKMHED5D94FQPZJQG87N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJMRT6YN0X6V4D292H54N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJNTDKYRPBZ2RXSK3M9E9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらはアートワークの時！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人一人違ったドレスが本当に素敵なんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、お顔にたくさんキラキラ付けてもらったんですー！キラキラ大好きなので嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJPWSJF2V71M2SQ84W0RV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これキラキラ分かりやすいかもー\nまつ毛にもキラキラ乗せてもらってたんだー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の脳波はどんな意味があるんだろうなー\nブックレットもたくさん見てねー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リニューアルオープン後初の、SHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんお邪魔しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リニューアルオープンおめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も愛がこもった素敵な展示をして頂きました！\n一つ一つ本当に嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJQZV721017VSDBR3XZX7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJS8KQXMPDNTHPQTWFVEF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人パネルは冬優花さんと隣でしたー！\nハートしましたよー！ぜひこの前で撮ってくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJTC1VQF6CR0787Y4KEH1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、こちら！\nたくさん嬉しい言葉が書いてありました。\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お近くにお越しの際はぜひ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回ユニット曲「イザベルについて」は、サクラミーツメンバーなんです！\n気づいてた？みんなで嬉しいね！って言い合いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パフォーマンス楽しみにしていてくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいば〜い🦒"}],"source":"archive"}